{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive the Swarm\u2014at Sea.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the fight to the open ocean in this fast-paced top-down roguelite shooter where you pilot everything from a humble raft to a full-blown battleship. Battle relentless hordes of mutant sea creatures, upgrade your firepower, and see how long you can stay afloat in this nautical twist on the auto-shooter genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose your ship. Pick your weapon. Aim. Survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this 2D top-down arena shooter, you\u2019ll start each run by selecting your vessel and a primary weapon, which you manually aim with the mouse. As the ocean gets deadlier by the second, you\u2019ll gather upgrades, unlock new ship weapons that auto-fire at nearby threats, and build an unstoppable floating fortress\u2014or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759610/extras/gameplay_gif.gif?t=1749536631\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle waves of aggressive sea creatures in real-time combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and pilot unique ships\u2014from makeshift rafts to war-ready battleships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manually aim your starter weapon for precision, while new weapons auto-fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your arsenal and combine weapons for devastating synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roguelite progression: No two runs are the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against elite enemies and monstrous bosses from the deep</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3759610?t=1749536631","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s